sment","reason":"Retrying assessment for the five HR-approved candidates after two parse failures.","ok":false,"summary":"error: Invalid structured output for Assessment: JSON Parse error: Unable to parse JSON string","phase":"ASSESS"},{"n":16,"name":"create_assessment","reason":"Bulk assessment has failed three times with the same parse error; testing a single candidate to isolate whether the array size is the problem.","ok":true,"summary":"{\"created\":1,\"assessments\":[{\"candidate_id\":\"c156\",\"assessment_id\":\"asm_vzoa7p_c156\",\"targets\":[\"API","phase":"ASSESS"},{"n":17,"name":"create_assessment","reason":"Single-candidate creation worked for c156, so I'm batching the remaining four to conserve the call budget (9 left); c122 targets Postgres, the others target API design.","ok":false,"summary":"error: Invalid structured output for Assessment: JSON Parse error: Unable to parse JSON string","phase":"ASSESS"},{"n":18,"name":"create_assessment","reason":"Batched creation keeps failing and single creation works; creating c049's assessment alone, targeting API design.","ok":true,"summary":"{\"created\":1,\"assessments\":[{\"candidate_id\":\"c049\",\"assessment_id\":\"asm_vzoa7p_c049\",\"targets\":[\"API","phase":"ASSESS"},{"n":19,"name":"create_assessment","reason":"Single-candidate creation is the only form that works; creating c066's API design assessment.","ok":true,"summary":"{\"created\":1,\"assessments\":[{\"candidate_id\":\"c066\",\"assessment_id\":\"asm_vzoa7p_c066\",\"targets\":[\"API","phase":"ASSESS"},{"n":20,"name":"create_assessment","reason":"Single-candidate creation is the only form that works; creating c002's API design assessment.","ok":true,"summary":"{\"created\":1,\"assessments\":[{\"candidate_id\":\"c002\",\"assessment_id\":\"asm_vzoa7p_c002\",\"targets\":[\"API","phase":"ASSESS"},{"n":21,"name":"create_assessment","reason":"Last outstanding assessment; c122's Postgres citation was only a strengths-list phrase, so the question targets m3.