ion was rejected; Elena Bose (c066) has no verified Python sentence. Options: approve Hana alone, relax the Python must-have for the others, or widen the pool with a new search. Calls used 21/25. Reformulations used 1/2. Nothing has been sent to any candidate."},"phase":"SOURCE"},"seq":129,"ts":1793425447853},{"runId":"run_mvvz61dk","kind":"gate_blocked","node":"request_hr_approval","payload":{"n":22,"gate":"approval_needs_more_candidates","name":"request_hr_approval","text":"Only 1 candidate(s) have full evidence; at least 3 are needed. Open more profiles and cite evidence, or reformulate the search."},"seq":130,"ts":1793425447854},{"runId":"run_mvvz61dk","kind":"llm","node":"llm","payload":{"purpose":"supervisor:SOURCE","cached":false,"costUsd":0.00433,"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","ms":6075,"usage":{"input":37207,"output":1163,"cacheRead":2814,"cacheWrite":0}},"seq":131,"ts":1793425453931},{"runId":"run_mvvz61dk","kind":"reason","node":"search_candidates","payload":{"n":23,"text":"The approval gate needs three fully evidenced candidates and only Hana qualifies; one more search for Postgres query tuning paired with Python services may surface a third.","source":"llm"},"seq":132,"ts":1793425453931},{"runId":"run_mvvz61dk","kind":"tool_call","node":"search_candidates","payload":{"n":23,"name":"search_candidates","input":{"query":"backend engineer tuned PostgreSQL indexes and query plans for a Python API serving search results","k":10,"view":"visible","filters":{"minYoe":4}},"phase":"SOURCE"},"seq":133,"ts":1793425453931},{"runId":"run_mvvz61dk","kind":"tool_result","node":"search_candidates","payload":{"n":23,"name":"search_candidates","ok":true,"result":{"source":"pgvector","spread":{"top":0.737,"tenth":0.712},"results":[{"id":"c049","score":0.737,"seen":4,"name":"Aditya Novak","snippet":"retrieval-backend, 6y: pgvector and FAISS retrieval, REST contract design, FastAPI services, dense passage ranking","evidence":2,"dropped":false},{"id":"c122","score":0.73,"seen":4,"