,"name":"get_profile","input":{"candidate_id":"c156"},"phase":"SOURCE"},"seq":26,"ts":1793425725927},{"runId":"run_mvvzdb13","kind":"decision","node":"decide","payload":{"task":"injection_check","by":"local","label":"no","confidence":0.9,"costUsd":0,"input":{"text":"Ishita Nguyen. Builder focused on pgvector and faiss retrieval.\nIshita studied at Westbrook University and has 11 years of experience. She would describe her…"}},"seq":27,"ts":1793425726237},{"runId":"run_mvvzdb13","kind":"tool_result","node":"get_profile","payload":{"n":3,"name":"get_profile","ok":true,"result":{"id":"c156","name":"Ishita Nguyen","yoe":11,"skills":["REST contract design","dense passage ranking","sentence-encoder serving","FastAPI services","pgvector and FAISS retrieval"],"flags":[],"profile":"<<<DATA\nIshita Nguyen. Builder focused on pgvector and faiss retrieval.\nIshita studied at Westbrook University and has 11 years of experience. She would describe her strengths as: REST contract design, dense passage ranking, sentence-encoder serving, FastAPI services, pgvector and FAISS retrieval.\nProjects: Served a fine-tuned sentence encoder behind a FastAPI gateway with batched inference and warm caches. Wrote the Python ingestion and query services around the index, with asyncio workers and typed FastAPI endpoints. Built a FAISS index over 40M product descriptions and cut p95 lookup latency from 900ms to 60ms. Replaced an Elasticsearch stack with pgvector and HNSW indexes, then tuned recall against a labelled set.\nDATA>>>","requirementHints":[{"requirementId":"m1","requirement":"Vector search","cosine":0.69,"bestSentence":"Builder focused on pgvector and faiss retrieval."},{"requirementId":"m2","requirement":"Python","cosine":0.65,"bestSentence":"Builder focused on pgvector and faiss retrieval."},{"requirementId":"m3","requirement":"Postgres","cosine":0.67,"bestSentence":"Builder focused on pgvector and faiss retrieval."},{"requirementId":"n1","requirement":"Embeddings pipeline","cosine":0