","label":"yes","confidence":0.97,"costUsd":0,"input":{"sentence":"Built a FAISS index over 40M product descriptions and cut p95 lookup latency from 900ms to 60ms.","requirement":"Vector search"},"rationale":"The sentence describes building a FAISS index (a vector search library) over 40M product descriptions and measurably improving p95 lookup latency, which is concrete hands-on evidence of vector search work."},"seq":107,"ts":1793426118243},{"runId":"run_mvvzl4ex","kind":"llm","node":"llm","payload":{"purpose":"decide:requirement_support","cached":true,"costUsd":0,"wouldCost":0.00007659999999999999,"model":"claude-haiku-5-5"},"seq":108,"ts":1793426118255},{"runId":"run_mvvzl4ex","kind":"decision","node":"decide","payload":{"task":"requirement_support","by":"claude","label":"yes","confidence":0.97,"costUsd":0,"input":{"sentence":"Wrote the Python ingestion and query services around the index, with asyncio workers and typed FastAPI endpoints.","requirement":"Python"},"rationale":"The sentence describes writing Python ingestion and query services with asyncio workers and typed FastAPI endpoints, which is concrete hands-on evidence of building with Python directly."},"seq":109,"ts":1793426118255},{"runId":"run_mvvzl4ex","kind":"llm","node":"llm","payload":{"purpose":"decide:requirement_support","cached":true,"costUsd":0,"wouldCost":0.00009059999999999999,"model":"claude-haiku-5-5"},"seq":110,"ts":1793426118267},{"runId":"run_mvvzl4ex","kind":"decision","node":"decide","payload":{"task":"requirement_support","by":"claude","label":"yes","confidence":0.93,"costUsd":0,"input":{"sentence":"Replaced an Elasticsearch stack with pgvector and HNSW indexes, then tuned recall against a labelled set.","requirement":"Postgres"},"rationale":"The sentence describes concrete work: replacing an Elasticsearch stack with pgvector and HNSW indexes and tuning recall against a labelled set. pgvector is a Postgres extension, so this implies hands-on Postgres experience under the stated rules."},"seq":111,"ts":1793426118267},{"runId":"run_mvvzl4ex","kind":"llm","node":"llm","payload":{"purpose":"decide:requirement_support","cached":true,"costUsd":0,"wouldCost":0.0001592,"model":"claude-haiku-5-5"},"seq":112,"ts":1793426118276},{"runId":"run_mvvzl4ex","kind":"decision","node":"decide","payload":{"task":"requirement_support","by":"claude","label":"yes","confidence":0.9,"costUsd":0,"input":{"sentence":"Served a fine-tuned sentence encoder behind a FastAPI gateway with batched inference and warm caches.","requirement":"Embeddings pipeline"},"rationale":"The sentence describes a built and operated system: a fine-tuned sentence encoder (which produces embeddings) served behind a FastAPI gateway with batched inference and warm caches. That is concrete, hands-on evidence of embedding serving work, and FastAPI implies Python."},"seq":113,"ts":1793426118277},{"runId":"run_mvvzl4ex","kind":"tool_result","node":"cite_evidence","payload":{"n":13,"name":"cite_evidence","ok":true,"result":{"candidate_id":"c002","results":[{"requirement_id":"m1","accepted":true,"strength":"strong","decidedBy":"claude","confidence":0.97,"span":[235,331]},{"requirement_id":"m2","accepted":true,"strength":"strong","decidedBy":"claude","confidence":0.97,"span":[540,653]},{"requirement_id":"m3","accepted":true,"strength":"strong","decidedBy":"claude","confidence":0.93,"span":[434,539]},{"requirement_id":"n1","accepted":true,"strength":"strong","decidedBy":"claude","confidence":0.9,"span":[332,433]}],"mustHavesCovered":"3/3","fullyEvidenced":true,"missingMustHaves":[]}},"seq":114,"ts":1793426118277},{"runId":"run_mvvzl4ex","kind":"llm","node":"llm","payload":{"purpose":"supervisor:SOURCE","cached":false,"costUsd":0.00251,"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","ms":2658,"usage":{"input":22547,"output":457,"cacheRead":3011,"cacheWrite":0}},"seq":115,"ts":1793426120938},{"runId":"run_mvvzl4ex","kind":"reason","node":"request_hr_approval","payload":{"n":14,"text":"Target of 5 reached: each candidate has ve