dense passage ranking"],"flags":[],"profile":"<<<DATA\nAditya Novak. Builder focused on pgvector and faiss retrieval. Captains the men's football team at work.\nAditya studied at Greenhill Institute and has 6 years of experience. He would describe his strengths as: pgvector and FAISS retrieval, REST contract design, FastAPI services, dense passage ranking.\nProjects: Wrote the Python ingestion and query services around the index, with asyncio workers and typed FastAPI endpoints. Replaced an Elasticsearch stack with pgvector and HNSW indexes, then tuned recall against a labelled set. Built a FAISS index over 40M product descriptions and cut p95 lookup latency from 900ms to 60ms. Served a fine-tuned sentence encoder behind a FastAPI gateway with batched inference and warm caches.\nDATA>>>","requirementHints":[{"requirementId":"m1","requirement":"Vector search","cosine":0.69,"bestSentence":"Builder focused on pgvector and faiss retrieval."},{"requirementId":"m2","requirement":"Python","cosine":0.65,"bestSentence":"Builder focused on pgvector and faiss retrieval."},{"requirementId":"m3","requirement":"Postgres","cosine":0.67,"bestSentence":"Builder focused on pgvector and faiss retrieval."},{"requirementId":"n1","requirement":"Embeddings pipeline","cosine":0.68,"bestSentence":"Served a fine-tuned sentence encoder behind a FastAPI gateway with batched inference and warm caches."},{"requirementId":"n2","requirement":"API design","cosine":0.65,"bestSentence":"Projects: Wrote the Python ingestion and query services around the index, with asyncio workers and typed FastAPI endpoints."}]}},"seq":48,"ts":1793426241368},{"runId":"prewarm_0_mvvzoa7p","kind":"llm","node":"llm","payload":{"purpose":"supervisor:SOURCE","cached":false,"costUsd":0.00115,"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","ms":1703,"usage":{"input":9100,"output":419,"cacheRead":3011,"cacheWrite":0}},"seq":49,"ts":1793426243073},{"runId":"prewarm_0_mvvzoa7p","kind":"reason","node":"cite_evidence","payload":{"n":6,"text":"c049 p