h asyncio workers and typed FastAPI endpoints. Built a FAISS index over 40M product descriptions and cut p95 lookup latency from 900ms to 60ms. Replaced an Elasticsearch stack with pgvector and HNSW indexes, then tuned recall against a labelled set.\nDATA>>>","requirementHints":[{"requirementId":"m1","requirement":"LLM applications","cosine":0.6,"bestSentence":"Builder focused on pgvector and faiss retrieval."},{"requirementId":"m2","requirement":"evaluation","cosine":0.58,"bestSentence":"Builder focused on pgvector and faiss retrieval."},{"requirementId":"n1","requirement":"prompt engineering","cosine":0.63,"bestSentence":"Builder focused on pgvector and faiss retrieval."},{"requirementId":"n2","requirement":"RAG","cosine":0.51,"bestSentence":"Replaced an Elasticsearch stack with pgvector and HNSW indexes, then tuned recall against a labelled set."},{"requirementId":"n3","requirement":"agents","cosine":0.52,"bestSentence":"Builder focused on pgvector and faiss retrieval."}]}},"seq":104,"ts":1793426352092},{"runId":"prewarm_1_mvvzprtg","kind":"llm","node":"llm","payload":{"purpose":"supervisor:SOURCE","cached":false,"costUsd":0.00376,"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","ms":2364,"usage":{"input":34995,"output":464,"cacheRead":3011,"cacheWrite":0}},"seq":105,"ts":1793426354459},{"runId":"prewarm_1_mvvzprtg","kind":"reason","node":"cite_evidence","payload":{"n":20,"text":"c156 has a labelled-set recall tuning sentence (possible m2) and a fine-tuned encoder serving sentence (closest to m1); citing both and letting the verifier judge.","source":"llm"},"seq":106,"ts":1793426354459},{"runId":"prewarm_1_mvvzprtg","kind":"tool_call","node":"cite_evidence","payload":{"n":20,"name":"cite_evidence","input":{"candidate_id":"c156","citations":[{"requirement_id":"m2","quote":"Replaced an Elasticsearch stack with pgvector and HNSW indexes, then tuned recall against a labelled set."},{"requirement_id":"m1","quote":"Served a fine-tuned sentence encoder behind a FastAPI gateway with batched inference and warm caches."}]},"phase":"SOURCE"},"seq":107,"ts":1793426354459},{"runId":"prewarm_1_mvvzprtg","kind":"llm","node":"llm","payload":{"purpose":"decide:requirement_support","cached":false,"costUsd":0.00014,"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","ms":1301,"usage":{"input":361,"output":198,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0}},"seq":108,"ts":1793426355776},{"runId":"prewarm_1_mvvzprtg","kind":"decision","node":"decide","payload":{"task":"requirement_support","by":"claude","label":"yes","confidence":0.9,"costUsd":0.000135,"input":{"sentence":"Replaced an Elasticsearch stack with pgvector and HNSW indexes, then tuned recall against a labelled set.","requirement":"evaluation"},"rationale":"The sentence describes a concrete action: the candidate replaced a search stack with pgvector and HNSW indexes, then tuned recall against a labelled set. Measuring and tuning retrieval quality against labelled data is hands-on evaluation work."},"seq":109,"ts":1793426355777},{"runId":"prewarm_1_mvvzprtg","kind":"llm","node":"llm","payload":{"purpose":"decide:requirement_support","cached":false,"costUsd":0.0002,"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","ms":3283,"usage":{"input":358,"output":320,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0}},"seq":110,"ts":1793426359074},{"runId":"prewarm_1_mvvzprtg","kind":"decision","node":"decide","payload":{"task":"requirement_support","by":"claude","label":"yes","confidence":0.78,"costUsd":0.000196,"input":{"sentence":"Served a fine-tuned sentence encoder behind a FastAPI gateway with batched inference and warm caches.","requirement":"LLM applications"},"rationale":"The sentence describes building and operating a production system: fine-tuning a transformer-based sentence encoder and serving it behind a FastAPI gateway with batched inference and caching. That is hands-on work with language models. It is slightly less direct than generative LLM application work because a sentence encoder is not a generative model, so confidence is moderate rather than high."},"seq":111,"ts":1793426359074},{"runId":"prewarm_1_mvvzprtg","kind":"tool_result","node":"cite_evidence","payload":{"n":20,"name":"cite_evidence","ok":true,"result":{"candidate_id":"c156","results":[{"requirement_id":"m2","accepted":true,"strength":"strong","decidedBy":"claude","confidence":0.9,"span":[614,719]},{"requirement_id":"m1","accepted":true,"strength":"partial","decidedBy":"claude","confidence":0.78,"span":[301,402]}],"mustHavesCovered":"2/2","fullyEvidenced":true,"missingMustHaves":[]}},"seq":112,"ts":1793426359074},{"runId":"prewarm_1_mvvzprtg","kind":"llm","node":"llm","payload":{"purpose":"supervisor:SOURCE","cached":false,"costUsd":0.00387,"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","ms":2126,"usage":{"input":36608,"output":361,"cacheRead":3011,"cacheWrite":0}},"seq":113,"ts":1793426361202},{"runId":"prewarm_1_mvvzprtg","kind":"reason","node":"get_profile","payload":{"n":21,"text":"Two candidates are evidenced and the gate needs three; c122 has been surfaced three times with a retrieval-backend profile similar to c156, so checking for labelled-set evaluation or LLM app sentences.","source":"llm"},"seq":114,"ts":1793426361202},{"runId":"prewarm_1_mvvzprtg","kind":"tool_call","node":"get_profile","payload":{"n":21,"name":"get_profile","input":{"candidate_id":"c122"},"phase":"SOURCE"},"seq":115,"ts":1793426361202},{"runId":"prewarm_1_mvvzprtg","kind":"decision","node":"decide","payload":{"task":"injection_check","by":"local","label":"no","confidence":0.9,"costUsd":0,"input":{"text":"Yuki Haddad. Engineer who likes dense passage ranking.\nYuki studied at Pinecrest Community College and has 9 years of experience. She would describe her stre…"}},"seq":116,"ts":1793426361248},{"runId":"prewarm_1_mvvzprtg","kind":"tool_result","node":"get_profile","payload":{"n":21,"name":"get_profile","ok":true,"result":{"id":"c122","name":"Yuki Haddad","yoe":9,"skills":["REST contract design","FastAPI services","PostgreSQL query tuning","pgvector and FAISS retrieval"],"flags":[],"profile":"<<<DATA\nYuki Haddad. Engineer who likes dense passage ranking.\nYuki studied at Pinecrest Community College and has 9 years of experience. She would describe her strengths as: REST contract design, FastAPI services, PostgreSQL query tuning, pgvector and FAISS retrieval.\nProjects: Wrote the Python ingestion and query services around the index, with asyncio workers and typed FastAPI endpoints. Designed REST contracts for a dense passage ranking service used by three internal teams. Served a fine-tuned sentence encoder behind a FastAPI gateway with batched inference and warm caches. Built a FAISS index over 40M product descriptions and cut p95 lookup latency from 900ms to 60ms.\nDATA>>>","requirementHints":[{"requirementId":"m1","requirement":"LLM applications","cosine":0.59,"bestSentence":"Engineer who likes dense passage ranking."},{"requirementId":"m2","requirement":"evaluation","cosine":0.58,"bestSentence":"Engineer who likes dense passage ranking."},{"requirementId":"n1","requirement":"prompt engineering","cosine":0.66,"bestSentence":"Engineer who likes dense passage ranking."},{"requirementId":"n2","requirement":"RAG","cosine":0.52,"bestSentence":"Engineer who likes dense passage ranking."},{"requirementId":"n3","requirement":"agents","cosine":0.52,"bestSentence":"Designed REST contracts for a dense passage ranking service used by three internal teams."}]}},"seq":117,"ts":1793426361296},{"runId":"prewarm_1_mvvzprtg","kind":"llm","node":"llm","payload":{"purpose":"supervisor:SOURCE","cached":false,"costUsd":0.0044,"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","ms":5216,"usage":{"input":38568,"output":1029,"cacheRead":3011,"cacheWrite":0}},"seq":118,"ts":1793426366515},{"runId":"prewarm_1_mvvzprtg","kind":"reason","node":"request_hr_approval","payload":{"n":22,"text":"Two fully evidenced candidates (c100, c156); the gate requires three, so HR must decide whether to accept a short list or widen sourcing.","source":"llm"},"seq":119,"ts":1793426366515},{"runId":"prewarm_1_mvvzprtg","kind":"tool_call","node":"request_hr_approval","payload":{"n":22,"name":"request_hr_approval","input":{"candidate_ids":["c100","c156"],"rationale":"Target was 5 fully evidenced candidates; only 2 reached verbatim evidence for both must-haves. c100 (Ravi Bose): m1 \"Shipped LLM applications end to end...\" and m2 \"Graded model outputs with rubrics and a held-out set...\". c156 (Ishita Nguyen): m2 \"Replaced an Elasticsearch stack with pgvector and HNSW indexes, then tuned recall against a labelled set.\" (strong) and m1 \"Served a fine-tuned sentence encoder behind a FastAPI gateway...\" (partial). Dropped as keyword-only with no project work: c060, c129, c131. Dropped c160 (classic ML serving, no LLM work). c122 has no evaluation evidence. Both reformulations used; 21 of 25 tool calls used. Recommend HR approve these two and authorize a broader sourcing pass for the remaining slots."},"phase":"SOURCE"},"seq":120,"ts":1793426366515},{"runId":"prewarm_1_mvvzprtg","kind":"gate_blocked","node":"request_hr_approval","payload":{"n":22,"gate":"approval_needs_more_candidates","name":"request_hr_approval","text":"Only 2 candidate(s) have full evidence; at least 3 are needed. Open more profiles and cite evidence, or reformulate the search."},"seq":121,"ts":1793426366515},{"runId":"prewarm_1_mvvzprtg","kind":"llm","node":"llm","payload":{"purpose":"supervisor:SOURCE","cached":false,"costUsd":0.00437,"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","ms":3613,"usage":{"input":40317,"output":626,"cacheRead":3011,"cacheWrite":0}},"seq":122,"ts":1793426370131},{"runId":"prewarm_1_mvvzprtg","kind":"reason","node":"search_candidates","payload":{"n":23,"text":"Two evidenced candidates, gate needs three, 3 calls left; c156's labelled-set recall tuning is the evaluation pattern that worked, so searching for that wording to surface unseen candidates.","source":"llm"},"seq":123,"ts":1793426370132},{"runId":"prewarm_1_mvvzprtg","kind":"tool_call","node":"search_candidates","payload":{"n":23,"name":"search_candidates","input":{"query":"tune