at Greenhill Institute and has 6 years of experience. She would describe her strengths as: dense passage ranking, PostgreSQL query tuning, FastAPI services.\nProjects: Built a FAISS index over 40M product descriptions and cut p95 lookup latency from 900ms to 60ms. Served a fine-tuned sentence encoder behind a FastAPI gateway with batched inference and warm caches. Replaced an Elasticsearch stack with pgvector and HNSW indexes, then tuned recall against a labelled set. Wrote the Python ingestion and query services around the index, with asyncio workers and typed FastAPI endpoints.\nDATA>>>","requirementHints":[{"requirementId":"m1","requirement":"LLM applications","cosine":0.56,"bestSentence":"Builder focused on dense passage ranking."},{"requirementId":"m2","requirement":"evaluation","cosine":0.57,"bestSentence":"Replaced an Elasticsearch stack with pgvector and HNSW indexes, then tuned recall against a labelled set."},{"requirementId":"n1","requirement":"prompt engineering","cosine":0.59,"bestSentence":"Builder focused on dense passage ranking."},{"requirementId":"n2","requirement":"RAG","cosine":0.51,"bestSentence":"Replaced an Elasticsearch stack with pgvector and HNSW indexes, then tuned recall against a labelled set."},{"requirementId":"n3","requirement":"agents","cosine":0.5,"bestSentence":"Served a fine-tuned sentence encoder behind a FastAPI gateway with batched inference and warm caches."}]}},"seq":130,"ts":1793426373147},{"runId":"prewarm_1_mvvzprtg","kind":"llm","node":"llm","payload":{"purpose":"supervisor:SOURCE","cached":false,"costUsd":0.00482,"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","ms":3535,"usage":{"input":44670,"output":654,"cacheRead":3011,"cacheWrite":0}},"seq":131,"ts":1793426376685},{"runId":"prewarm_1_mvvzprtg","kind":"reason","node":"cite_evidence","payload":{"n":25,"text":"c002 has a labelled-set recall tuning sentence (m2) and a fine-tuned encoder serving sentence (closest to m1); last call before budget ends.","source":"llm"},"seq":132,"ts":1793426376