se, SQL, streaming. Spark, data pipelines.\nJay studied at Lakeside State University and has 1 years of experience. They would describe their strengths as: Spark, data pipelines, Airflow, data warehouse, SQL, streaming.\nProjects: Wrote test plans for quarterly releases. Built a Cypress regression suite covering 400 flows.\nDATA>>>","requirementHints":[{"requirementId":"m1","requirement":"Spark","cosine":0.77,"bestSentence":"Spark, data pipelines."},{"requirementId":"m2","requirement":"SQL","cosine":0.64,"bestSentence":"Keywords: Spark, data pipelines, Airflow, data warehouse, SQL, streaming."},{"requirementId":"m3","requirement":"Data pipelines","cosine":0.87,"bestSentence":"Spark, data pipelines."},{"requirementId":"n1","requirement":"Airflow","cosine":0.62,"bestSentence":"Passionate about Spark, data pipelines and Airflow."},{"requirementId":"n2","requirement":"Streaming","cosine":0.68,"bestSentence":"Keywords: Spark, data pipelines, Airflow, data warehouse, SQL, streaming."}]}},"seq":46,"ts":1793426395595},{"runId":"prewarm_2_mvvzrdvj","kind":"llm","node":"llm","payload":{"purpose":"supervisor:SOURCE","cached":false,"costUsd":0.00129,"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","ms":2405,"usage":{"input":10724,"output":375,"cacheRead":3011,"cacheWrite":0}},"seq":47,"ts":1793426398002},{"runId":"prewarm_2_mvvzrdvj","kind":"reason","node":"get_profile","payload":{"n":7,"text":"Jay Moreau's profile is mostly keyword lists with a QA background, so weak evidence; checking Manish Petrov (c051), a data-engineering profile with PySpark and dbt, instead.","source":"llm"},"seq":48,"ts":1793426398002},{"runId":"prewarm_2_mvvzrdvj","kind":"tool_call","node":"get_profile","payload":{"n":7,"name":"get_profile","input":{"candidate_id":"c051"},"phase":"SOURCE"},"seq":49,"ts":1793426398002},{"runId":"prewarm_2_mvvzrdvj","kind":"decision","node":"decide","payload":{"task":"injection_check","by":"local","label":"no","confidence":0.9,"costUsd":0,"input":{"text":"Manish Petrov. Builder focused on pyspark and databricks jobs.\nManish studied at Lakeside State University and has 7 years of experience. He would describe h…"}},"seq":50,"ts":1793426398045},{"runId":"prewarm_2_mvvzrdvj","kind":"tool_result","node":"get_profile","payload":{"n":7,"name":"get_profile","ok":true,"result":{"id":"c051","name":"Manish Petrov","yoe":7,"skills":["Snowflake and BigQuery modelling","ELT with dbt","PySpark and Databricks jobs"],"flags":[],"profile":"<<<DATA\nManish Petrov. Builder focused on pyspark and databricks jobs.\nManish studied at Lakeside State University and has 7 years of experience. He would describe his strengths as: Snowflake and BigQuery modelling, ELT with dbt, PySpark and Databricks jobs.\nProjects: Owned DAG orchestration for 200+ daily tasks with retries and SLA alerts. Rebuilt nightly PySpark jobs on Databricks and cut the batch window from 6 hours to 50 minutes. Modelled a Snowflake warehouse with dbt, with tests on every mart. Wrote the SQL that reconciles finance and product marts, with window functions and tested dbt models.\nDATA>>>","requirementHints":[{"requirementId":"m1","requirement":"Spark","cosine":0.65,"bestSentence":"Builder focused on pyspark and databricks jobs."},{"requirementId":"m2","requirement":"SQL","cosine":0.65,"bestSentence":"Wrote the SQL that reconciles finance and product marts, with window functions and tested dbt models."},{"requirementId":"m3","requirement":"Data pipelines","cosine":0.65,"bestSentence":"Builder focused on pyspark and databricks jobs."},{"requirementId":"n1","requirement":"Airflow","cosine":0.49,"bestSentence":"Projects: Owned DAG orchestration for 200+ daily tasks with retries and SLA alerts."},{"requirementId":"n2","requirement":"Streaming","cosine":0.54,"bestSentence":"Builder focused on pyspark and databricks jobs."}]}},"seq":51,"ts":1793426398093},{"runId":"prewarm_2_mvvzrdvj","kind":"llm","node":"llm","payload":{"purpose":"supervisor:SOURCE","cached":false,"costUsd":0.00147,"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","ms":1