passage ranking.\nProjects: Wrote the ingestion and query services around the index in FastAPI, with asyncio workers and typed Pydantic models. Replaced an Elasticsearch stack with pgvector and HNSW indexes, then tuned recall against a labelled set. Built a FAISS index over 40M product descriptions and cut p95 lookup latency from 900ms to 60ms. Served a fine-tuned sentence encoder behind a FastAPI gateway with batched inference and warm caches.\nDATA>>>","requirementHints":[{"requirementId":"m1","requirement":"Vector search","cosine":0.69,"bestSentence":"Builder focused on pgvector and faiss retrieval."},{"requirementId":"m2","requirement":"Python","cosine":0.65,"bestSentence":"Builder focused on pgvector and faiss retrieval."},{"requirementId":"m3","requirement":"Postgres","cosine":0.67,"bestSentence":"Builder focused on pgvector and faiss retrieval."},{"requirementId":"n1","requirement":"Embeddings pipeline","cosine":0.68,"bestSentence":"Served a fine-tuned sentence encoder behind a FastAPI gateway with batched inference and warm caches."},{"requirementId":"n2","requirement":"API design","cosine":0.64,"bestSentence":"Projects: Wrote the ingestion and query services around the index in FastAPI, with asyncio workers and typed Pydantic models."}]}},"seq":10,"ts":1793426925562},{"runId":"run_mvw030fz","kind":"llm","node":"llm","payload":{"purpose":"supervisor:SOURCE","cached":false,"costUsd":0.00083,"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","ms":2155,"usage":{"input":5807,"output":444,"cacheRead":3220,"cacheWrite":0}},"seq":11,"ts":1793426927720},{"runId":"run_mvw030fz","kind":"reason","node":"cite_evidence","payload":{"n":4,"text":"c049's profile has project sentences covering all three must-haves and both nice-to-haves, so I'll cite them in one call.","source":"llm"},"seq":12,"ts":1793426927720},{"runId":"run_mvw030fz","kind":"tool_call","node":"cite_evidence","payload":{"n":4,"name":"cite_evidence","input":{"candidate_id":"c049","citations":[{"requirement_id":"m1","quote":"Built 