\nElena Bose. Builder focused on sentence-encoder serving.\nElena studied at Carrow National Institute and has 8 years of experience. She would describe her strengths as: pgvector and FAISS retrieval, sentence-encoder serving, FastAPI services, dense passage ranking, REST contract ownership.\nProjects: Replaced an Elasticsearch stack with pgvector and HNSW indexes, then tuned recall against a labelled set. Built a FAISS index over 40M product descriptions and cut p95 lookup latency from 900ms to 60ms. Owned the REST contracts for a dense passage ranking service used by three internal teams. Served a fine-tuned sentence encoder behind a FastAPI gateway with batched inference and warm caches.\nDATA>>>","requirementHints":[{"requirementId":"m1","requirement":"Vector search","cosine":0.68,"bestSentence":"Projects: Replaced an Elasticsearch stack with pgvector and HNSW indexes, then tuned recall against a labelled set."},{"requirementId":"m2","requirement":"Python","cosine":0.63,"bestSentence":"Builder focused on sentence-encoder serving."},{"requirementId":"m3","requirement":"Postgres","cosine":0.63,"bestSentence":"Projects: Replaced an Elasticsearch stack with pgvector and HNSW indexes, then tuned recall against a labelled set."},{"requirementId":"n1","requirement":"Embeddings pipeline","cosine":0.68,"bestSentence":"Served a fine-tuned sentence encoder behind a FastAPI gateway with batched inference and warm caches."},{"requirementId":"n2","requirement":"API design","cosine":0.62,"bestSentence":"Projects: Replaced an Elasticsearch stack with pgvector and HNSW indexes, then tuned recall against a labelled set."}]}},"seq":42,"ts":1793426934901},{"runId":"run_mvw030fz","kind":"llm","node":"llm","payload":{"purpose":"supervisor:SOURCE","cached":false,"costUsd":0.00155,"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","ms":1830,"usage":{"input":12943,"output":441,"cacheRead":3220,"cacheWrite":0}},"seq":43,"ts":1793426936733},{"runId":"run_mvw030fz","kind":"reason","node":"cite_evidence","payload"