uning","FastAPI services"],"flags":[],"profile":"<<<DATA\nHana Tanaka. Builder focused on dense passage ranking.\nHana studied at Greenhill Institute and has 6 years of experience. She would describe her strengths as: dense passage ranking, PostgreSQL query tuning, FastAPI services.\nProjects: Built a FAISS index over 40M product descriptions and cut p95 lookup latency from 900ms to 60ms. Served a fine-tuned sentence encoder behind a FastAPI gateway with batched inference and warm caches. Replaced an Elasticsearch stack with pgvector and HNSW indexes, then tuned recall against a labelled set. Wrote the ingestion and query services around the index in FastAPI, with asyncio workers and typed Pydantic models.\nDATA>>>","requirementHints":[{"requirementId":"m1","requirement":"Vector search","cosine":0.65,"bestSentence":"Replaced an Elasticsearch stack with pgvector and HNSW indexes, then tuned recall against a labelled set."},{"requirementId":"m2","requirement":"Python","cosine":0.61,"bestSentence":"Served a fine-tuned sentence encoder behind a FastAPI gateway with batched inference and warm caches."},{"requirementId":"m3","requirement":"Postgres","cosine":0.61,"bestSentence":"Replaced an Elasticsearch stack with pgvector and HNSW indexes, then tuned recall against a labelled set."},{"requirementId":"n1","requirement":"Embeddings pipeline","cosine":0.68,"bestSentence":"Served a fine-tuned sentence encoder behind a FastAPI gateway with batched inference and warm caches."},{"requirementId":"n2","requirement":"API design","cosine":0.6,"bestSentence":"Wrote the ingestion and query services around the index in FastAPI, with asyncio workers and typed Pydantic models."}]}},"seq":105,"ts":1793427221652},{"runId":"run_mvw09e3zybn","kind":"llm","node":"llm","payload":{"purpose":"supervisor:SOURCE","cached":true,"costUsd":0,"wouldCost":0.0022634,"model":"claude-haiku-5-5"},"seq":106,"ts":1793427221664},{"runId":"run_mvw09e3zybn","kind":"reason","node":"cite_evidence","payload":{"n":12,"text":"c002's project sentences cover FAISS vector search, FastAPI Python services, and pgvector/HNSW Postgres work, which should satisfy all three must-haves.","source":"llm"},"seq":107,"ts":1793427221664},{"runId":"run_mvw09e3zybn","kind":"tool_call","node":"cite_evidence","payload":{"n":12,"name":"cite_evidence","input":{"candidate_id":"c002","citations":[{"requirement_id":"m1","quote":"Built a FAISS index over 40M product descriptions and cut p95 lookup latency from 900ms to 60ms."},{"requirement_id":"m2","quote":"Wrote the ingestion and query services around the index in FastAPI, with asyncio workers and typed Pydantic models."},{"requirement_id":"m3","quote":"Replaced an Elasticsearch stack with pgvector and HNSW indexes, then tuned recall against a labelled set."},{"requirement_id":"n1","quote":"Served a fine-tuned sentence encoder behind a FastAPI gateway with batched inference and warm caches."},{"requirement_id":"n2","quote":"Wrote the ingestion and query services around the index in FastAPI, with asyncio workers and typed Pydantic models."}]},"phase":"SOURCE"},"seq":108,"ts":1793427221664},{"runId":"run_mvw09e3zybn","kind":"llm","node":"llm","payload":{"purpose":"decide:requirement_support","cached":true,"costUsd":0,"wouldCost":0.0000794,"model":"claude-haiku-5-5"},"seq":109,"ts":1793427221680},{"runId":"run_mvw09e3zybn","kind":"decision","node":"decide","payload":{"task":"requirement_support","by":"claude","label":"yes","confidence":0.97,"costUsd":0,"input":{"sentence":"Built a FAISS index over 40M product descriptions and cut p95 lookup latency from 900ms to 60ms.","requirement":"Vector search"},"rationale":"The sentence describes building a FAISS index (a vector search library) over 40M product descriptions and measurably improving p95 lookup latency, which is concrete hands-on evidence of vector search work."},"seq":110,"ts":1793427221681},{"runId":"run_mvw09e3zybn","kind":"llm","node":"llm","payload":{"purpose":"decide:requirement_support","cac