":"c066","requirement_id":"m2","quote":"Served a fine-tuned sentence encoder behind a FastAPI gateway with batched inference and warm caches."}}],"stopReason":"tool_use","usage":{"input":11756,"output":202,"cacheRead":2814,"cacheWrite":0},"model":"claude-haiku-5-5"},"costUsd":0.0013047400000000002,"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","ts":1793425741352},"908228e07aaf5445eac4a18a4579a5d49e46b927a89fbc73b81ddd3c75103e2f":{"response":{"text":"{\"label\":\"yes\",\"confidence\":0.92,\"rationale\":\"The sentence describes concrete work: serving a fine-tuned sentence encoder behind a FastAPI gateway with batched inference and warm caches. FastAPI is a Python framework, so this implies hands-on Python experience under the stated rules.\"}","toolUses":[],"stopReason":"end_turn","usage":{"input":355,"output":168,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0},"model":"claude-haiku-5-5"},"costUsd":0.0001195,"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","ts":1793425742730},"d3ae37561ee81d5c6003f2494f6a5cf7aec441b60920d614380a7b69bebda92e":{"response":{"text":"Two candidates (c156 and c066) are now fully evidenced. I'll open the next vector-search match, Aditya Novak (c049), to check for must-have evidence.","toolUses":[{"id":"toolu_01AVDWGPpr12yqeVSxLg6VtD","name":"get_profile","input":{"reason":"Next high-similarity retrieval-backend candidate (sem 0.78) with pgvector and FAISS listed; checking for verbatim must-have evidence.","candidate_id":"c049"}}],"stopReason":"tool_use","usage":{"input":12803,"output":253,"cacheRead":2814,"cacheWrite":0},"model":"claude-haiku-5-5"},"costUsd":0.0014349400000000002,"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","ts":1793425744351},"407e822792b4d8c2b0e66681d9ca579c39621f620c50577f326f7067838b1a1b":{"response":{"text":"","toolUses":[{"id":"toolu_01Ur7pVchUcyXaCrzDA741o7","name":"cite_evidence","input":{"reason":"Aditya's profile describes building a FAISS index over 40M descriptions, which is vector search evidence for m1.","candidate_id":"c049","requirement_id":"m1","quote":"Built a FAISS index over 40M pr