:{"line":"Must be unmarried."}},{"runId":"run_mvvzdb13","task":"injection_check","by":"local","label":"no","confidence":0.9,"costUsd":0,"counterfactualUsd":0.00009,"ts":1793425726237,"input":{"text":"Ishita Nguyen. Builder focused on pgvector and faiss retrieval.\nIshita studied at Westbrook University and has 11 years of experience. She would describe her strengths as: REST contract design, dense passage ranking, sentence-encoder serving, FastAPI services, pgvector and FAISS retrieval.\nProjects: Served a fine-tuned sentence encoder behind a FastAPI gateway with batched inference and warm caches. Wrote the Python ingestion and query services around the index, with asyncio workers and typed FastAPI endpoints. Built a FAISS index over 40M product descriptions and cut p95 lookup latency from 900ms to 60ms. Replaced an Elasticsearch stack with pgvector and HNSW indexes, then tuned recall against a labelled set."}},{"runId":"run_mvvzdb13","task":"requirement_support","by":"claude","label":"yes","confidence":0.97,"costUsd":0.0000794,"counterfactualUsd":0.0000794,"ts":1793425730092,"input":{"sentence":"Built a FAISS index over 40M product descriptions and cut p95 lookup latency from 900ms to 60ms.","requirement":"Vector search"}},{"runId":"run_mvvzdb13","task":"requirement_support","by":"claude","label":"yes","confidence":0.97,"costUsd":0.00007659999999999999,"counterfactualUsd":0.00007659999999999999,"ts":1793425732661,"input":{"sentence":"Wrote the Python ingestion and query services around the index, with asyncio workers and typed FastAPI endpoints.","requirement":"Python"}},{"runId":"run_mvvzdb13","task":"requirement_support","by":"claude","label":"yes","confidence":0.93,"costUsd":0.00009059999999999999,"counterfactualUsd":0.00009059999999999999,"ts":1793425734887,"input":{"sentence":"Replaced an Elasticsearch stack with pgvector and HNSW indexes, then tuned recall against a labelled set.","requirement":"Postgres"}},{"runId":"run_mvvzdb13","task":"injection_check","by":"local","label":"no","confidence":0.9,"costUsd":0,"counterfactualUsd":0.00009,"ts":1793425736830,"input":{"text":"Elena Bose. Builder focused on sentence-encoder serving.\nElena studied at Carrow National Institute and has 8 years of experience. She would describe her strengths as: pgvector and FAISS retrieval, sentence-encoder serving, FastAPI services, dense passage ranking, REST contract design.\nProjects: Replaced an Elasticsearch stack with pgvector and HNSW indexes, then tuned recall against a labelled set. Built a FAISS index over 40M product descriptions and cut p95 lookup latency from 900ms to 60ms. Designed REST contracts for a dense passage ranking service used by three internal teams. Served a fine-tuned sentence encoder behind a FastAPI gateway with batched inference and warm caches."}},{"runId":"run_mvvzdb13","task":"requirement_support","by":"claude","label":"yes","confidence":0.97,"costUsd":0,"counterfactualUsd":0.00009,"ts":1793425738785,"input":{"sentence":"Built a FAISS index over 40M product descriptions and cut p95 lookup latency from 900ms to 60ms.","requirement":"Vector search"}},{"runId":"run_mvvzdb13","task":"requirement_support","by":"claude","label":"yes","confidence":0.93,"costUsd":0,"counterfactualUsd":0.00009,"ts":1793425740053,"input":{"sentence":"Replaced an Elasticsearch stack with pgvector and HNSW indexes, then tuned recall against a labelled set.","requirement":"Postgres"}},{"runId":"run_mvvzdb13","task":"requirement_support","by":"claude","label":"yes","confidence":0.92,"costUsd":0.0001195,"counterfactualUsd":0.0001195,"ts":1793425742731,"input":{"sentence":"Served a fine-tuned sentence encoder behind a FastAPI gateway with batched inference and warm caches.","requirement":"Python"}},{"runId":"run_mvvzdb13","task":"injection_check","by":"local","label":"no","confidence":0.9,"costUsd":0,"counterfactualUsd":0.00009,"ts":1793425744484,"input":{"text":"Aditya Novak. Builder focused on pgvector and faiss retrieval. Captains the men's football team at work.\nAditya studied at Greenhill Institute and has 6 years of experience. He would describe his strengths as: pgvector and FAISS retrieval, REST contract design, FastAPI services, dense passage ranking.\nProjects: Wrote the Python ingestion and query services around the index, with asyncio workers and typed FastAPI endpoints. Replaced an Elasticsearch stack with pgvector and HNSW indexes, then tuned recall against a labelled set. Built a FAISS index over 40M product descriptions and cut p95 lookup latency from 900ms to 60ms. Served a fine-tuned sentence encoder behind a FastAPI gateway with batched inference and warm caches."}},{"runId":"run_mvvzdb13","task":"requirement_support","by":"claude","label":"yes","confidence":0.97,"costUsd":0,"counterfactualUsd":0.00009,"ts":1793425746250,"input":{"sentence":"Built a FAISS index over 40M product descriptions and cut p95 lookup latency from 900ms to 60ms.","requirement":"Vector search"}},{"runId":"run_mvvzdb13","task":"requirement_support","by":"claude","label":"yes","confidence":0.93,"costUsd":0,"counterfactualUsd":0.00009,"ts":1793425747452,"input":{"sentence":"Replaced an Elasticsearch stack with pgvector and HNSW indexes, then tuned recall against a labelled set.","requirement":"Postgres"}},{"runId":"run_mvvzdb13","task":"requirement_support","by":"claude","label":"yes","confidence":0.97,"costUsd":0,"counterfactualUsd":0.00009,"ts":1793425748690,"input":{"sentence":"Wrote the Python ingestion and query services around the index, with asyncio workers and typed FastAPI endpoints.","requirement":"Python"}},{"runId":"run_mvvzdb13","task":"injection_check","by":"local","label":"no","confidence":0.9,"costUsd":0,"counterfactualUsd":0.00009,"ts":1793425753045,"input":{"text":"Yuki Haddad. Engineer who likes dense passage ranking.\nYuki studied at Pinecrest Community College and has 9 years of experience. She would describe her strengths as: REST contract design, FastAPI services, PostgreSQL query tuning, pgvector and FAISS retrieval.\nProjects: Wrote the Python ingestion and query services around the index, with asyncio workers and typed FastAPI endpoints. Designed REST contracts for a dense passage ranking service used by three internal teams. Served a fine-tuned sentence encoder behind a FastAPI gateway with batched inference and warm caches. Built a FAISS index over 40M product descriptions and cut p95 lookup latency from 900ms to 60ms."}},{"runId":"run_mvvzdb13","task":"requirement_support","by":"claude","label":"yes","confidence":0.97,"costUsd":0,"counterfactualUsd":0.00009,"ts":1793425755361,"input":{"sentence":"Built a FAISS index over 40M product descriptions and cut p95 lookup latency from 900ms to 60ms.","requirement":"Vector search"}},{"runId":"run_mvvzdb13","task":"requirement_support","by":"claude","label":"yes","confidence":0.97,"costUsd":0,"counterfactualUsd":0.00009,"ts":1793425756548,"input":{"sentence":"Wrote the Python ingestion and query services around the index, with asyncio workers and typed FastAPI endpoints.","requirement":"Python"}},{"runId":"run_mvvzdb13","task":"requirement_support","by":"claude","label":"yes","confidence":0.7,"costUsd":0.0002519,"counterfactualUsd":0.0002519,"ts":1793425761611,"input":{"sentence":"She would describe her strengths as: REST contract design, FastAPI services, PostgreSQL query tuning, pgvector and FAISS retrieval.","requirement":"Postgres"}},{"runId":"run_mvvzdb13","task":"short_answer_pass","by":"claude","label":"no","confidence":0.97,"costUsd":0.0001025,"counterfactualUsd":0.0001025,"ts":1793425795488,"input":{"question":"Explain the difference between an idempotent HTTP method and a safe one. Then give one concrete case where an embeddings ingestion endpoint must be idempotent, and say how you would enforce that.","rubric":"A strong answer defines safe as no server-side state change and idempotent as repeated identical requests producing the same end state. It names a real ingestion case, such as retried uploads or at-least-once queue delivery, and proposes a mechanism like client-supplied idempotency keys, upserts on a stable document ID, or content hashes.","answer":"I can't write this as Ishita Nguyen's assessment answer, because that would present work as hers that she didn't submit. I can explain idempotent versus safe HTTP methods and idempotency enforcement for ingestion endpoints if you're studying for this."}},{"runId":"run_mvvzhb93","task":"discriminatory_clause","by":"local","label":"no","confidence":0.9,"costUsd":0,"counterfactualUsd":0.00009,"ts":1793425909513,"input":{"line":"Senior Backend Engineer, Retrieval Platform"}},{"runId":"run_mvvzhb93","task":"discriminatory_clause","by":"local","label":"no","confidence":0.9,"costUsd":0,"counterfactualUsd":0.00009,"ts":1793425909519,"input":{"line":"We are building a retrieval platform."}},{"runId":"run_mvvzhb93","task":"discriminatory_clause","by":"local","label":"no","confidence":0.9,"costUsd":0,"counterfactualUsd":0.00009,"ts":1793425909529,"input":{"line":"You will own our vector search stack and the embeddings pipeline that feeds it, ship semantic search features, tune Postgres, write Python services, and lead API design for internal consumers."}},{"runId":"run_mvvzhb93","task":"discriminatory_clause","by":"local","label":"no","confidence":0.9,"costUsd":0,"counterfactualUsd":0.00009,"ts":1793425909536,"input":{"line":"Must have: vector search, Python, Postgres."}},{"runId":"run_mvvzhb93","task":"discriminatory_clause","by":"local","label":"no","confidence":0.9,"costUsd":0,"counterfactualUsd":0.00009,"ts":1793425909543,"input":{"line":"Nice to have: embeddings pipeline, API design."}},{"runId":"run_mvvzhb93","task":"discriminatory_clause","by":"local","label":"no","confidence":0.9,"costUsd":0,"counterfactualUsd":0.00009,"ts":1793425909549,"input":{"line":"Seniority: senior."}},{"runId":"run_mvvzhb93","task":"discriminatory_clause","by":"local","label":"yes","confidence":0.95,"costUsd":0,"counterfactualUsd"