:"no","confidence":0.9,"costUsd":0,"counterfactualUsd":0.00009,"ts":1793426244448,"input":{"text":"Elena Bose. Builder focused on sentence-encoder serving.\nElena studied at Carrow National Institute and has 8 years of experience. She would describe her strengths as: pgvector and FAISS retrieval, sentence-encoder serving, FastAPI services, dense passage ranking, REST contract design.\nProjects: Replaced an Elasticsearch stack with pgvector and HNSW indexes, then tuned recall against a labelled set. Built a FAISS index over 40M product descriptions and cut p95 lookup latency from 900ms to 60ms. Designed REST contracts for a dense passage ranking service used by three internal teams. Served a fine-tuned sentence encoder behind a FastAPI gateway with batched inference and warm caches."}},{"runId":"prewarm_0_mvvzoa7p","task":"requirement_support","by":"claude","label":"yes","confidence":0.97,"costUsd":0,"counterfactualUsd":0.00009,"ts":1793426246690,"input":{"sentence":"Built a FAISS index over 40M product descriptions and cut p95 lookup latency from 900ms to 60ms.","requirement":"Vector search"}},{"runId":"prewarm_0_mvvzoa7p","task":"requirement_support","by":"claude","label":"yes","confidence":0.92,"costUsd":0,"counterfactualUsd":0.00009,"ts":1793426246700,"input":{"sentence":"Served a fine-tuned sentence encoder behind a FastAPI gateway with batched inference and warm caches.","requirement":"Python"}},{"runId":"prewarm_0_mvvzoa7p","task":"requirement_support","by":"claude","label":"yes","confidence":0.93,"costUsd":0,"counterfactualUsd":0.00009,"ts":1793426246711,"input":{"sentence":"Replaced an Elasticsearch stack with pgvector and HNSW indexes, then tuned recall against a labelled set.","requirement":"Postgres"}},{"runId":"prewarm_0_mvvzoa7p","task":"requirement_support","by":"claude","label":"yes","confidence":0.9,"costUsd":0,"counterfactualUsd":0.00009,"ts":1793426246721,"input":{"sentence":"Served a fine-tuned sentence encoder behind a FastAPI gateway with batche