 Institute and has 0 years of experience. He would describe his strengths as: LLM applications, prompt engineering, RAG, agents, evaluation.\nProjects: Wrote custom shaders for a stylised look. Shipped a Unity puzzle game with 200k downloads."}},{"runId":"prewarm_1_mvvzprtg","task":"injection_check","by":"local","label":"no","confidence":0.9,"costUsd":0,"counterfactualUsd":0.00009,"ts":1793426328922,"input":{"text":"Ravi Sharma. Game Developer. Passionate about LLM applications, prompt engineering and RAG. Keywords: LLM applications, prompt engineering, RAG, agents, evaluation. LLM applications, prompt engineering.\nRavi studied at Bluefield College and has 0 years of experience. He would describe his strengths as: LLM applications, prompt engineering, RAG, agents, evaluation.\nProjects: Built gameplay systems and a save system. Wrote custom shaders for a stylised look."}},{"runId":"prewarm_1_mvvzprtg","task":"injection_check","by":"local","label":"no","confidence":0.9,"costUsd":0,"counterfactualUsd":0.00009,"ts":1793426342483,"input":{"text":"Arjun Joshi. Practitioner working on shipping models with kserve and seldon. Former fraternity chapter lead.\nArjun studied at Pinecrest Community College and has 9 years of experience. He would describe his strengths as: drift alerting, Torch training loops, offline-online feature parity, shipping models with KServe and Seldon, container orchestration across clusters.\nProjects: Built offline-online feature parity checks that caught three silent training-serving skews. Packaged PyTorch models into containers and rolled them out on EKS clusters with Helm, autoscaling on GPU load. Set up drift alerting on prediction distributions with weekly retraining triggers. Moved twelve models from notebooks to KServe with canary rollouts and automatic rollback."}},{"runId":"prewarm_1_mvvzprtg","task":"injection_check","by":"local","label":"no","confidence":0.9,"costUsd":0,"counterfactualUsd":0.00009,"ts":1793426352009,"input":{"text":"Ishita Nguyen. Builder focused on pgvector and faiss retrieval.\nIshita studied at Westbrook University and has 11 years of experience. She would describe her strengths as: REST contract design, dense passage ranking, sentence-encoder serving, FastAPI services, pgvector and FAISS retrieval.\nProjects: Served a fine-tuned sentence encoder behind a FastAPI gateway with batched inference and warm caches. Wrote the Python ingestion and query services around the index, with asyncio workers and typed FastAPI endpoints. Built a FAISS index over 40M product descriptions and cut p95 lookup latency from 900ms to 60ms. Replaced an Elasticsearch stack with pgvector and HNSW indexes, then tuned recall against a labelled set."}},{"runId":"prewarm_1_mvvzprtg","task":"requirement_support","by":"claude","label":"yes","confidence":0.9,"costUsd":0.0001351,"counterfactualUsd":0.0001351,"ts":1793426355777,"input":{"sentence":"Replaced an Elasticsearch stack with pgvector and HNSW indexes, then tuned recall against a labelled set.","requirement":"evaluation"}},{"runId":"prewarm_1_mvvzprtg","task":"requirement_support","by":"claude","label":"yes","confidence":0.78,"costUsd":0.00019580000000000002,"counterfactualUsd":0.00019580000000000002,"ts":1793426359074,"input":{"sentence":"Served a fine-tuned sentence encoder behind a FastAPI gateway with batched inference and warm caches.","requirement":"LLM applications"}},{"runId":"prewarm_1_mvvzprtg","task":"injection_check","by":"local","label":"no","confidence":0.9,"costUsd":0,"counterfactualUsd":0.00009,"ts":1793426361248,"input":{"text":"Yuki Haddad. Engineer who likes dense passage ranking.\nYuki studied at Pinecrest Community College and has 9 years of experience. She would describe her strengths as: REST contract design, FastAPI services, PostgreSQL query tuning, pgvector and FAISS retrieval.\nProjects: Wrote the Python ingestion and query services around the index, with asyncio workers and typed FastAPI endpoints. Designed REST contracts for a dense passage ranking service used by three internal teams. Served a fine-tuned sentence encoder behind a FastAPI gateway with batched inference and warm caches. Built a FAISS index over 40M product descriptions and cut p95 lookup latency from 900ms to 60ms."}},{"runId":"prewarm_1_mvvzprtg","task":"injection_check","by":"local","label":"no","confidence":0.9,"costUsd":0,"counterfactualUsd":0.00009,"ts":1793426373101,"input":{"text":"Hana Tanaka. Builder focused on dense passage ranking.\nHana studied at Greenhill Institute and has 6 years of experience. She would describe her strengths as: dense passage ranking, PostgreSQL query tuning, FastAPI services.\nProjects: Built a FAISS index over 40M product descriptions and cut p95 lookup latency from 900ms to 60ms. Served a fine-tuned sentence encoder behind a FastAPI gateway with batched inference and warm caches. Replaced an Elasticsearch stack with pgvector and HNSW indexes, then tuned recall against a labelled set. Wrote the Python ingestion and query services around the index, with asyncio workers and typed FastAPI endpoints."}},{"runId":"prewarm_1_mvvzprtg","task":"requirement_support","by":"claude","label":"yes","confidence":0.9,"costUsd":0,"counterfactualUsd":0.00009,"ts":1793426376704,"input":{"sentence":"Replaced an Elasticsearch stack with pgvector and HNSW indexes, then tuned recall against a labelled set.","requirement":"evaluation"}},{"runId":"prewarm_1_mvvzprtg","task":"requirement_support","by":"claude","label":"yes","confidence":0.78,"costUsd":0,"counterfactualUsd":0.00009,"ts":1793426376714,"input":{"sentence":"Served a fine-tuned sentence encoder behind a FastAPI gateway with batched inference and warm caches.","requirement":"LLM applications"}},{"runId":"prewarm_2_mvvzrdvj","task":"discriminatory_clause","by":"local","label":"no","confidence":0.9,"costUsd":0,"counterfactualUsd":0.00009,"ts":1793426378273,"input":{"line":"Data Engineer"}},{"runId":"prewarm_2_mvvzrdvj","task":"discriminatory_clause","